-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §22: the work week of a school principal
-- under the reform — a position base of 40 weekly hours; the working day,
-- 8:00 to 16:00 or 17:00, and 8:00 to 13:00 or 14:00 on the short day, the
-- later hours being those that complete the 40 when his free day is a long
-- one; 3 to 6 frontal teaching hours, and management and the evaluation of
-- teachers in the rest; role hours within the school; 2.4 management hours
-- less for a mother of a child under 14, at no cost to her position or pay;
-- the age rules unchanged; and the 60-minute hour of presence.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `22 מבנה שבוע העבודה של מנהל בית ספר ברפורמה`

DECLARE `Oz section 22 action` IS ONE OF
    `do his role hours within the school's walls`

-- akn:art_22/p1 The opening: a principal's week "ברפורמה" (in full or in part) is as (א)–(ח) set out; for the years of part application §30 sets the base, the frontal hours and the hour again, and governs where it does (oz-founding-30, F-oz-founding-30-a).

§§ `22(א)`

-- (א): a principal's position base is 40 weekly hours (ש"ש), a position
-- of 100%.
@ref akn:art_22__para_a
`the Oz principal's position base` MEANS 40

§§ `22(ב)–(ג)`

-- (ב): a principal's working hours are 8:00 to 16:00 / 17:00 on Sunday to
-- Thursday, and 8:00 to 13:00 / 14:00 on Friday (in a non-Jewish sector,
-- Saturday or Sunday): the short day. (ג) says what the later hour is: the
-- hour from 16:00 to 17:00, or from 13:00 to 14:00, in which a principal
-- whose free day is not the short day completes the 40 weekly hours. Hours
-- are written as numbers of the clock.
@ref akn:art_22__para_b akn:art_22__para_b/p2 akn:art_22__para_b/p3
DECLARE `day of an Oz principal's week` IS ONE OF
    `a long day of the principal's week`
    `the short day of the principal's week`

`the hour an Oz principal's working day starts` MEANS 8

GIVEN d IS A `day of an Oz principal's week`, `he completes an hour that day` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hour an Oz principal's working day ends` d `he completes an hour that day` IS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `a long day of the principal's week` THEN IF `he completes an hour that day` THEN 17 ELSE 16
    WHEN `the short day of the principal's week` THEN IF `he completes an hour that day` THEN 14 ELSE 13

`long days in an Oz principal's week` MEANS 5

-- (ג): a principal whose free day is not the short day does the hours
-- needed to complete the 40 in the windows from 16:00 to 17:00 on Sunday
-- to Thursday "and/or" from 13:00 to 14:00 on the short day: as many as
-- (ב)'s days fall short of 40, in whichever of the windows of the days he
-- works. With a long day free, (ב)'s days hold 4 × 8 + 5 = 37 hours, and
-- he completes 3.
@ref akn:art_22__para_c
DECLARE `the Oz principal's free day` IS ONE OF
    `a long day is the principal's free day`
    `the short day is the principal's free day`
    `the principal has no free day`

GIVEN free IS A `the Oz principal's free day`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the long days an Oz principal works` free IS
    IF free EQUALS `a long day is the principal's free day`
    THEN `long days in an Oz principal's week` MINUS 1
    ELSE `long days in an Oz principal's week`

GIVEN free IS A `the Oz principal's free day`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the short days an Oz principal works` free IS
    IF free EQUALS `the short day is the principal's free day` THEN 0 ELSE 1

GIVEN d IS A `day of an Oz principal's week`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hours of an Oz principal's day by (ב)` d IS
    `the hour an Oz principal's working day ends` d FALSE MINUS `the hour an Oz principal's working day starts`

GIVEN free IS A `the Oz principal's free day`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hours an Oz principal's days hold by (ב)` free IS
      `the long days an Oz principal works` free TIMES `the hours of an Oz principal's day by (ב)` `a long day of the principal's week`
    + `the short days an Oz principal works` free TIMES `the hours of an Oz principal's day by (ב)` `the short day of the principal's week`

GIVEN free IS A `the Oz principal's free day`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hours an Oz principal completes` free IS
    IF free EQUALS `a long day is the principal's free day`
    THEN `the Oz principal's position base` MINUS `the hours an Oz principal's days hold by (ב)` free
    ELSE 0

-- A way of completing them keeps to (ג): an hour at most in the window of
-- each long day he works, an hour at most in the short day's window, and
-- the hours (ג) asks, together.
GIVEN free IS A `the Oz principal's free day`
      `completed on the long days` IS A NUMBER @desc in the 16:00–17:00 windows, together
      `completed on the short day` IS A NUMBER @desc in the 13:00–14:00 window
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an Oz principal completes his week as (ג) asks` free `completed on the long days` `completed on the short day` IF
        `completed on the long days` AT LEAST 0
    AND `completed on the long days` AT MOST `the long days an Oz principal works` free
    AND `completed on the short day` AT LEAST 0
    AND `completed on the short day` AT MOST `the short days an Oz principal works` free
    AND `completed on the long days` PLUS `completed on the short day` EQUALS `the hours an Oz principal completes` free

§§ `22(ד)`

-- (ד): of the 40 weekly hours, 3 to 6 are frontal teaching hours (in
-- fact), as the Ministry of Education's guidelines say; how many, within
-- the range, is theirs. "3 עד 6" is a range and 6 is in it (an exception
-- to convention thresholds.until). In the rest the principal manages the
-- school and evaluates teachers.
@ref akn:art_22__para_d
GIVEN frontal IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `frontal hours an Oz principal may teach` frontal IF
    frontal AT LEAST 3 AND frontal AT MOST 6

GIVEN frontal IS A NUMBER, `management hours section 22(ו) takes off` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz principal's hours of management and evaluation` frontal `management hours section 22(ו) takes off` IS
    `the Oz principal's position base` MINUS frontal MINUS `management hours section 22(ו) takes off`

`why a principal's frontal hours within the range are an input` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "הנחיות משרד החינוך בדבר שעות ההוראה הפרונטאלית של מנהל בית ספר"

§§ `22(ה)`

-- (ה): a principal does his role hours within the school's walls.
@ref akn:art_22__para_e
`a principal's role hours within the school` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `do his role hours within the school's walls`

§§ `22(ו)`

-- (ו): a principal who is a mother teacher — the mother of a child "עד גיל
-- 14", under 14 (convention thresholds.until) — and is employed on the
-- reform's terms (in full or in part) is entitled to 2.4 management hours
-- less, without her position or her pay being cut for it.
@ref akn:art_22__para_f
`the management hours a mother principal is spared` MEANS 2.4

GIVEN e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`, `the age of her youngest child` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a mother principal under section 22(ו)` e `the age of her youngest child` IF
        NOT e EQUALS `off the Oz reform`
    AND `the age of her youngest child` `is until` 14

GIVEN e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`, `the age of her youngest child` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the management hours section 22(ו) takes off` e `the age of her youngest child` IS
    IF `a mother principal under section 22(ו)` e `the age of her youngest child`
    THEN `the management hours a mother principal is spared`
    ELSE 0

-- Her position, and with it her pay, stays what it was.
GIVEN `her position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a mother principal's position after the reduction` `her position` IS
    `her position`

§§ `22(ז)`

-- (ז): the rules on reducing a principal's hours for age do not change;
-- they are not this agreement's.
@ref akn:art_22__para_g
`why a principal's age reduction is not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "הכללים החלים על מנהל בית ספר לעניין הפחתת שעות בשל גיל, כפי שהם"

§§ `22(ח)`

-- (ח): for the principal's weekly presence in the school (only), an hour
-- is 60 minutes; the length of a teaching period stays as the Ministry set
-- it.
@ref akn:art_22__para_h
`minutes in an hour of an Oz principal's presence` MEANS 60

GIVEN `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the minutes of an Oz principal's weekly presence` `weekly hours` IS
    `weekly hours` TIMES `minutes in an hour of an Oz principal's presence`

§§ `22 -- illustrations`

-- (ב)–(ג): with the short day free, (ב)'s days hold the 40; with a long
-- day free, 37, and 3 are completed — in three long days' windows, or in
-- two and the short day's — but not in five long days' windows
#ASSERT `the hours an Oz principal's days hold by (ב)` `the short day is the principal's free day` EQUALS `the Oz principal's position base`
#ASSERT `the hours an Oz principal completes` `a long day is the principal's free day` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `an Oz principal completes his week as (ג) asks` `a long day is the principal's free day` 3 0
#ASSERT `an Oz principal completes his week as (ג) asks` `a long day is the principal's free day` 2 1
#ASSERT NOT `an Oz principal completes his week as (ג) asks` `a long day is the principal's free day` 5 0
#ASSERT NOT `an Oz principal completes his week as (ג) asks` `the short day is the principal's free day` 0 1
#ASSERT `the hour an Oz principal's working day ends` `a long day of the principal's week` TRUE EQUALS 17
-- (ד): 3 and 6 frontal hours are both in; 6 leaves 34 hours of management
#ASSERT `frontal hours an Oz principal may teach` 3 AND `frontal hours an Oz principal may teach` 6 AND NOT `frontal hours an Oz principal may teach` 7
#ASSERT `the Oz principal's hours of management and evaluation` 6 0 EQUALS 34
-- (ו): a mother of a 13-year-old teaching 6 hours manages 31.6 of them, on
-- her full position; a mother of a 14-year-old, 34
#ASSERT `the Oz principal's hours of management and evaluation` 6 (`the management hours section 22(ו) takes off` `the Oz reform in full` 13) EQUALS 31.6
#ASSERT `the management hours section 22(ו) takes off` `the Oz reform in full` 14 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `a mother principal's position after the reduction` 1 EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the minutes of an Oz principal's weekly presence` `the Oz principal's position base` EQUALS 2400
